mileCo gifts are recorded this year, so the annual cap is not an issue. | None needed (within limits) |\n\n**Follow-ups:**\n- **Gift 3's \"Erik already pre-approved this\" note is unverified** — it's a claim in the file, not a recorded approval. It doesn't change the outcome (the gift is within limits anyway), but if you want it on record, Erik should confirm it.\n- **Gift 1** can only be accepted if Erik Sand explicitly approves it as an exception to the annual cap.\n- **Gift 2** should be declined and returned to OrthoLab."},
